snippet.description:
October 8, 2026 marked 2 years since my 1st ever POTA activation.  Sounded like a good reason to celebrate.  I kept it simple my throwing a Hamstick on the back glass and visiting with 33 of my friends.
Thanks to everyone who has helped to make the past two years so special.  
#pota 
#parksontheair 
#hamradio 
#amateurradio
#hamradiooperator 
#hamradiolife 
#hamradiocommunity 
#portableradio 
#radio 
#anniversary 

Equipment used:
@YaesuUSAOfficial FT-891
@ABRindCoax 
@LDGElectronics-2 Z-100 plus tuner
@sharkantenna Hamstick
@RigExpert_Ukraine Stick 230
@GigaPartsHuntsville 
@DXEngineering 
@ecoworthy_official 20ah battery

Thanks for watching.  If you like this video, please LIKE and consider subscribing.
Paul
KJ5GKK

